1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,406
Some alleles kill.

2
00:00:01,406 --> 00:00:05,260
In maize, a recessive allele blocks chlorophyll.

3
00:00:05,260 --> 00:00:11,328
Cross two green plants that both carry it, and seedlings come up three green to one white.

4
00:00:11,328 --> 00:00:14,622
But the white seedlings cannot photosynthesise.

5
00:00:14,622 --> 00:00:17,656
They die as soon as the food in the seed runs out.

